OL,3,GNEWSASamuel Smith's puts pubs on the
OL,4,Amarket for 'other uses'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPub campaigners have written to
OL,7,Fhistoric brewery Samuel Smith's to
OL,8,Fquestion the sale of a number of its
OL,9,Fbuildings on the open market.
OL,11,FThe Tadcaster-based company has listed
OL,12,Fseveral of its pubs, many of them in
OL,13,FNorth Yorkshire, for sale under
OL,14,F"non-pub use only" clauses.
OL,16,FThe Campaign for Real Ale (CAMRA) has
OL,17,Fwarned potential buyers that converting
OL,18,Fthe buildings may not be legally
OL,19,Fpossible under current planning rules.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
