OL,3,GNEWSASamuel Smith's puts pubs on the
OL,4,Amarket for 'other uses'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Samuel Smith's told
OL,7,Fthe BBC that the properties were being
OL,8,Fsold as they are "no longer viable" as
OL,9,Fpubs.
